{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of relentless effort, the protagonist finally achieves their lifelong dream. However, upon realizing this dream, they are overcome with a deep sense of emptiness and numbness. One day, while drowning their sorrows in alcohol, they come across a mysterious girl at the train station...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the president of a software company, the protagonist is responsible for managing and operating the business. From software development plans to various employee affairs, every aspect is personally overseen by the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are not only responsible for advancing the game's main storyline but can also freely explore various management and interactive gameplay elements to create a unique gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a company founder, responsible for operating and developing a software development company. By researching new software, recruiting and training employees, and optimizing budget management, they can help the company grow and enhance its market competitiveness. Players must allocate resources wisely, formulate development strategies, and ensure the company's steady progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a shop where players can purchase various items. Using these items strategically can effectively advance the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game incorporates heartwarming interactions between the protagonist and his daughter. Players can arrange time to spend with her and participate in her growth journey. Different choices will influence the depth of their father-daughter relationship and may even alter the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must find a balance between career and family, managing their company while maintaining a strong bond with their daughter, ultimately leading to different game endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382360/extras/e6745ca82feacb844ff5505e8653608a.avif?t=1750776204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382360/extras_big/e6745ca82feacb844ff5505e8653608a.avif?t=1750776204 width=800 height=480 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382360/extras/97e625dd7900922e8792d5f51cbf83e4.avif?t=1750776204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382360/extras_big/97e625dd7900922e8792d5f51cbf83e4.avif?t=1750776204 width=800 height=480 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382360/extras/2e162b43025cd19fb2aa75b8c208abf3.avif?t=1750776204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382360/extras_big/2e162b43025cd19fb2aa75b8c208abf3.avif?t=1750776204 width=800 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning of the Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382360/eadfd216bade5afaa76d4a54e774c798793c63f2.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian of the Fairy Tale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382360/d510e1c6fa645ff66ce39d23e756e59fc0bf0f9e.jpg"},{"name":"Together Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382360/bbc62be9a687bed448ce28e16d58de20b7ea2804.jpg"},{"name":"The Road to Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382360/324b5d767d927859107d79d3df67d53265ff6f43.jpg"},{"